  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Enhancing education sector policy, planning, management and monitoring</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This activity aims at enhancing the Member State&#x2019;s education sector policies, planning, management, and monitoring through global and country work. The work will be conducted through three modalities. (1) Better data, evidence, and guidance using a framework to analyze education systems, produce data and support policy-making for education transformation through partnerships and evidence-based tools. (2) Better knowledge management to stimulate policy dialogues, peer learning, and innovation in key policy areas such as education data and digital transformation. (3) Better support for system strengthening and reforms in the Member States through actively engaging in direct technical assistance to the Member States as well as technical backstopping to the UNESCO Field Offices as needed.</narrative>
  </description>
